syntax:
Comparison between signed and unsigned integers:

if (signed_int < unsigned_int) {
    // ...
}

// Implicit promotion rules:
// signed_int is promoted to unsigned_int if compared directly with unsigned_int

code_example:
unsigned int total_elements = sizeof(int) * 10;
int d = -1;
if (d < total_elements) {
    // Unexpectedly false because d is promoted to unsigned int,
    // making -1 become a large positive number.
}
